# Feedthing's site in Caddy on the box, uploaded by bin/deploy.
#
# Tailnet only: Caddy listens on 127.0.0.1, and `tailscale serve` publishes it
# as https://box.<tailnet>.ts.net:8421 with the box's Tailscale certificate,
# like Netdata's dashboard (infra repo, docs/operations.md). HTTPS matters:
# browsers only allow service workers, and so push notifications, on it.
http://:19921 {
	bind 127.0.0.1
	encode zstd gzip
	# Slot ports from deploy/app.conf, the app's name, its health check.
	import app 4021 4022 feedthing /healthz
}
